  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="ES">Buen Gobierno</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Capacity of Educational Communities</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="ES">Apoyar v&#xed;as para una participaci&#xf3;n y supervisi&#xf3;n p&#xfa;blicas significativas, as&#xed; como para una separaci&#xf3;n sustantiva de poderes a trav&#xe9;s de controles y equilibrios institucionales. La transparencia y la integridad tambi&#xe9;n son vitales para la eficacia del gobierno y la estabilidad pol&#xed;tica.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The purpose of this activity is to strengthen the capacity of educational communities (students, parents, teachers, school directors and education supervisors) of Ciudad del Este to collectively and responsibly demand accountability to improve the use of public funds in the education sector.</narrative>
  </description>
